Winston,

While you are thinking about generalizations of position, let me bring
up another thing that could be included.  Dodging is done in the
horizontal direction, stacking in the vertical, and jittering in both
the horizontal and vertical.  But this is an arbitrary limitation.
Vertical dodging makes sense for a categorical vertical axis and
horizontal bars or lines.  Horizontal stacking can make sense as well.

Hadley and I had a bit of discussion on this on the main ggplot list
awhile ago:
http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/browse_thread/thread/896a239293227116/141ca9e3e47bc464?#141ca9e3e47bc464

