> 1.
> The behavior of pos_stack() is currently undefined when ymin!=0. Here are two
> possible ways to define it: The objects could either be stacked with 0 as the
> baseline, or using the smallest ymin value of all the objects. In either case,
> it would be useful to have an option for stacking downward from the largest
