> and then
> you need to modify ggplot2/.git/config by hand to replace hadley with> your username - then you should be able to push.

Or, more formally, use

> git remote add name_of_repo url_of_repo
and then,

> git push name_of_repo name_of_branch

where, name_of_repo is arbitral name of repository (i.e. alias),
and you can find url on your github web page.

maybe you need

> git fetch name_of_repo

before push.

